# Eleven Views Harness

- Preserve the Eleven Views logo, gold palette, product title, and upstream attribution.
- Read the applicable `AGENTS.md` files before changing code. Nested instructions take precedence.
- Use `corepack pnpm run cursor:web` to launch the branded Web UI with the Cursor agent preset selected.
- Use `corepack pnpm run test:gui` for client visual changes. Run the narrow owning test first for other changes.
- Never add Cursor, model-provider, MCP, or other credentials to tracked files.
- `subagent_cursor` starts a fresh Cursor Agent through ACP with the active session workspace. Give it a complete standalone task.
- Do not start another server on port 3080 when the health check at `http://127.0.0.1:3080` already succeeds.
